# What the coding box may reach on the internet (devbox-egress;
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, "Outbound allowlist"). A domain covers its subdomains. Addresses and CIDRs
# work too, for a service with no name. Tailscale's own traffic needs no line.
#
# Add here and `make update`, or on the box (ssh root@devbox devbox-egress
# allow <domain>) and later `make egress-sync`. Agents ask for one with
# `devbox-egress request <domain> <why>`.

